{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And he cried, and he spoke</b> — the angel speaking in him by the word of HaShem, for the black ones going out to the land of the north executed HaShem's vengeance in the north. And this is the meaning of \"they have caused My spirit to rest\" — like \"and rule by His spirit.\" And the meaning of this vision, which the prophet made known to Israel, is that all of them who sit in the land of the north — and Jerusalem shall dwell securely."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:08.858186169Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}